The removal of the early set_bit in hci_uart_set_proto() prevents the flag from being set before proto->open(). The addition of set_bit after hu->proto->open(hu) in hci_uart_register_dev() ensures that hu->priv is fully initialized before any work scheduled by the flag can execute, thus preventing the null pointer dereference.

